{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">呂慧儀（阿蟹）於9月3日迎來44歲生日。過去9年多以來，她憑藉《愛·回家之開心速遞》中的「熊若水」一角深受觀眾喜愛；雖然劇集已於上月迎來大結局，但一眾演員私下的感情依然絲毫未減。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3ddbceed-40ae-4729-b2aa-436b4d5561d9.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ZRZQO1LYnb1788490094.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3ddbceed-40ae-4729-b2aa-436b4d5561d9.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阿蟹今年獲家人與好友為她準備了一連串的驚喜慶祝活動。除了李泳豪、湯盈盈、姚瑩瑩、沈可欣等人為她舉辦驚喜派對提前慶生外，她亦與「熊家人」劉丹、滕麗名、湯盈盈等人一齊飲茶及品嚐壽桃包，生日蛋糕食個不停，場面溫馨滿瀉。阿蟹隨後亦在社交平台上分享這份喜悅與溫暖，並感性寫道：「這真心實意的情誼，已是我最珍貴的禮物」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4aa97ab1-e87f-458a-ba01-3fd95f83cbcc.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026fhTScMmlm61788490094.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4aa97ab1-e87f-458a-ba01-3fd95f83cbcc.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e058502b-6716-4b5d-8858-c716e57e775c.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026OyaNHhBdeV1788490093.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e058502b-6716-4b5d-8858-c716e57e775c.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"48739c39-8fa9-4a6b-a27f-3783f91f0cd0.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026N8F3E3w9rq1788490094.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"48739c39-8fa9-4a6b-a27f-3783f91f0cd0.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">慶祝活動過後，阿蟹表示今年將不會再繼續慶祝，反而希望把大家的祝福轉化為善心。她呼籲親友今天可以去幫助別人、捐款或做善事，並在遇到任何事情時都以善念去包容體諒，為生活注入更多正能量，同時祝願大家都能過得平安順遂。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T03:25:57.408726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}